        "description": "Camille blasts in a cone after a delay, dealing damage. Enemies in the outer half are slowed and take extra damage, while also healing Camille.",
        "tooltip": "Camille winds up and slices, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(60/85/110/135/160 + (60% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>.<br /><br />Enemies hit by the outer half are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 80% decaying over 2 seconds, and they take an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(7/7.5/8/8.5/9% + (0.025% bonus Attack Damage)) max Health physical damage</span>. Camille restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">100% of the bonus damage dealt to champions as Health</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability does 50% less damage to non-epic jungle monsters.<br />Max health damage is capped at 300 against jungle monsters.</span>",
